    "notice": {
      "icon": "📋",
      "title": "Interim Rollout Document",
      "body": "A transitional resource for the first few weeks after go-live: a working list of common floor issues and fixes drawn from real day-to-day experience, meant to help the team get up to speed quickly — not a replacement for the official AGV and RCS user manuals, which remain the authoritative reference. This site is a living document and will be updated frequently as we learn more during this rollout period."
    }
